From 65e815e887774d58635f0e6bc8ff445c2c17c007 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: James Lacroix <jlacroix82@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 17:28:40 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] perf(serving): admit a buffered text batch in one engine
 message

Opt in on the batch chat endpoint. Validate and register the bounded greedy text requests before submitting a single engine-core queue item. Keep ordinary admission as the default and close collectors on cancellation.
